{
  "_comment": [
    "Behaviour baseline for the Scenario refactor. Run with:",
    "    python scripts/scenario_lock.py --verify scripts/scenario_lock_baseline.json",
    "",
    "Each entry names a config under src/syn_grid/config/scenarios/, the",
    "overrides held constant across the refactor, and the digests recorded from",
    "the PRE-refactor implementation. Every scenario must reproduce its",
    "digests exactly. A difference is behaviour the refactor moved, not noise.",
    "",
    "starting_score is raised on every scenario that would otherwise end on",
    "score debt, so the timeout branch is actually reached. continuous_score_debt",
    "inverts that on purpose: it is the only entry that exercises the",
    "score <= 0 termination branch.",
    "",
    "Re-baseline with --record only when a behaviour change is intended and",
    "separately justified. For an architectural refactor, it should never be."
  ],
